// Application status troubleshooter: pick the scheme and the problem, get the
// likely reason, fix steps and where to complain. Same URL and title; the
// description drops "लाइव" (the tool does not fetch live status).
// All answers are rendered as HTML (readable without JS); the script only
// shows the chosen one.
//
// Facts updated (checked Oct 2026):
// - PM-KISAN: eKYC mandatory (OTP on portal, biometric at CSC, face auth in
//   app); land seeding is done by the state from land records; helpline
//   155261 / 011-24300606 (pmkisan.gov.in). Old page linked the UP-only
//   Bhulekh site for everyone - removed.
// - EPFO: since Apr 2025 no cheque-leaf/passbook upload for online claims and
//   no employer approval for bank seeding (PIB release, labour.gov.in/sites/
//   default/files/pib2118168.pdf; business-standard.com 4 Apr 2025). Old page
//   told users to upload passbook and get employer approval - fixed.
// - Aadhaar bank seeding status: myAadhaar portal (old link
//   resident.uidai.gov.in/bank-mapper is the retired portal).
// - Removed unverified claims: "IPPB account auto-maps DBT in 24 hours",
//   "15-20 days and all past installments together".
